          "Added a statically allocated 256-entry Particle shared-memory tile and cooperative source staging, keeping one thread per target and processing source particles in the original sequential order.",
          "Handled partial tiles by loading and processing only valid source indices. Kept out-of-range target threads participating in all required block barriers, then skipped their output.",
          "Kept launch.json unchanged at 256 threads and preserved the baseline force formula, sqrtf use, self-interaction check, and Euler update; the tile occupies 7168 bytes per block."
        ]
